# The build context is the repository root (the image installs libs/runfile beside the viewer): only what the Dockerfile
# copies goes in. Nothing of the lab's data (duck/runs, ...) is ever sent to the daemon.
*
!libs/runfile/pyproject.toml
!libs/runfile/src
!viewer/pyproject.toml
!viewer/uv.lock
!viewer/src
!viewer/web
**/__pycache__/
